      "text": "and I'll be back in a moment."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 72.789,
      "end": 72.799,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "Hi everyone, welcome back."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 72.799,
      "end": 74.63,
      "duration": 1.831,
      "text": "Okay, so we're asked to find the general"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 74.64,
      "end": 78.07,
      "duration": 3.43,
      "text": "solution to the differential equation"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 78.08,
      "end": 83.749,
      "duration": 5.669,
      "text": "x dot dot + 8x dot sorry, plus 8x"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 83.759,
      "end": 89.03,
      "duration": 5.271,
      "text": "equals cossine omega t."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 90.87,
      "end": 90.88,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "And notice how this is a differential"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 90.88,
      "end": 92.95,
      "duration": 2.07,
      "text": "equation with constant coefficients, but"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 92.96,
      "end": 95.51,
      "duration": 2.55,
      "text": "it's being forced by a periodic function"
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 95.52,
      "end": 97.83,
      "duration": 2.31,
      "text": "on the right hand side. So the first"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 97.84,
      "end": 100.31,
      "duration": 2.47,
      "text": "thing to do is to write down the the"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 100.32,
      "end": 104.87,
      "duration": 4.55,
      "text": "homogeneous uh solution."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 106.469,
      "end": 106.479,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "So the homogeneous solution which I'll"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 106.479,
      "end": 110.87,
      "duration": 4.391,
      "text": "denote with a subscript h"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 113.429,
      "end": 113.439,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "solves the differential equation"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 113.439,
      "end": 117.429,
      "duration": 3.99,
      "text": "with the right hand side of zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 117.439,
      "end": 119.749,
      "duration": 2.31,
      "text": "This gives us a characteristic uh"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 119.759,
      "end": 122.069,
      "duration": 2.31,
      "text": "polomial"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 122.079,
      "end": 125.67,
      "duration": 3.591,
      "text": "of s^2 + 8"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 125.68,
      "end": 128.79,
      "duration": 3.11,
      "text": "= z"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 128.8,
      "end": 131.19,
      "duration": 2.39,
      "text": "which then gives us roots of plus or"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 131.2,
      "end": 136.229,
      "duration": 5.029,
      "text": "minus<unk> 8 i."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 143.83,
      "end": 143.84,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "is some constant C1."
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 143.84,
      "end": 145.75,
      "duration": 1.91,
      "text": "And when we have imaginary purely"
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 145.76,
      "end": 150.71,
      "duration": 4.95,
      "text": "imaginary roots, we have cosine"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 150.72,
      "end": 154.79,
      "duration": 4.07,
      "text": "of the imaginary term time t plus some"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 154.8,
      "end": 158.229,
      "duration": 3.429,
      "text": "constant c2 * s"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 158.239,
      "end": 160.949,
      "duration": 2.71,
      "text": "of the imaginary term in this case is"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 160.959,
      "end": 164.949,
      "duration": 3.99,
      "text": "roo<unk> 8 t."
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 166.869,
      "end": 166.879,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "So the general or sorry the homogeneous"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 166.879,
      "end": 169.589,
      "duration": 2.71,
      "text": "solution always contains two constants"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 169.599,
      "end": 171.11,
      "duration": 1.511,
      "text": "and it solves the differential equation"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 171.12,
      "end": 173.75,
      "duration": 2.63,
      "text": "with a zero right hand side."
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 173.76,
      "end": 175.75,
      "duration": 1.99,
      "text": "The general solution however is the"
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 175.76,
      "end": 178.39,
      "duration": 2.63,
      "text": "homogeneous solution plus one particular"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 178.4,
      "end": 180.15,
      "duration": 1.75,
      "text": "solution that solves the differential"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 180.16,
      "end": 184.869,
      "duration": 4.709,
      "text": "equation x dot dot + 8x= cosine omega t."
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 184.879,
      "end": 187.11,
      "duration": 2.231,
      "text": "So we just need to find one solution to"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 187.12,
      "end": 190.63,
      "duration": 3.51,
      "text": "this differential equation."
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 190.64,
      "end": 191.91,
      "duration": 1.27,
      "text": "And in this case, I'll use the"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 191.92,
      "end": 195.19,
      "duration": 3.27,
      "text": "exponential response formula."
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 195.2,
      "end": 197.27,
      "duration": 2.07,
      "text": "But first note that when we use the"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 197.28,
      "end": 199.19,
      "duration": 1.91,
      "text": "exponential response formula, we need a"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 199.2,
      "end": 202.07,
      "duration": 2.87,
      "text": "forcing to be of the form e to the s t"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 202.08,
      "end": 204.63,
      "duration": 2.55,
      "text": "on the right hand side. And cosine omega"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 204.64,
      "end": 207.91,
      "duration": 3.27,
      "text": "t is not in that form. However, what we"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 207.92,
      "end": 213.589,
      "duration": 5.669,
      "text": "can do is there's a trick"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 215.75,
      "end": 215.76,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "to complexify"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 215.76,
      "end": 217.27,
      "duration": 1.51,
      "text": "the right hand side. So we note that"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "start": 217.28,
      "end": 219.67,
      "duration": 2.39,
      "text": "cosine omega t is actually the real part"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "start": 219.68,
      "end": 224.63,
      "duration": 4.95,
      "text": "of i omega t."
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "start": 227.589,
      "end": 227.599,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "So what this means is"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "start": 227.599,
      "end": 230.789,
      "duration": 3.19,
      "text": "if we have a solution"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "start": 230.799,
      "end": 233.91,
      "duration": 3.111,
      "text": "a complex solution zed"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "start": 233.92,
      "end": 237.03,
      "duration": 3.11,
      "text": "which solves z dot dot + 8 zed equals e"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "start": 237.04,
      "end": 243.03,
      "duration": 5.99,
      "text": "to the i omega t."
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "start": 245.91,
      "end": 245.92,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "Then we can take x"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "start": 245.92,
      "end": 252.309,
      "duration": 6.389,
