      "text": "the differential equation x dot dot + 8x"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "start": 262.32,
      "end": 264.55,
      "duration": 2.23,
      "text": "equals the real part of the right hand"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "start": 264.56,
      "end": 270.55,
      "duration": 5.99,
      "text": "side cosine omega t."
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "start": 272.95,
      "end": 272.96,
      "duration": 0.01,
      "text": "And now we're in business because this"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "start": 272.96,
      "end": 276.31,
      "duration": 3.35,
      "text": "equation has the form uh where we we can"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "start": 276.32,
      "end": 279.27,
      "duration": 2.95,
      "text": "use the exponential response formula."
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "start": 279.28,
      "end": 280.87,
      "duration": 1.59,
      "text": "So solving this differential equation"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "start": 280.88,
      "end": 283.909,
      "duration": 3.029,
